  triage:snippet "quality-mgr AT2-QA-R2 re-verification: AT.2-receipt.md now carries an Immutable inputs table with sc-publish revision 42e0fcea23f730fae0ef3d08b060cd4df6a2602e, package digest 75da9d18426eacb92bab3e02bb6655a35e14f69deafe1ba2d00f4e93aabc0a5b, consumer-input SHA-256 ba518f7f1d10fc25d788d15bf68398483fd1691b9604dabbb83196d74b23d2c2, and rendered-manifest SHA-256s for release/publish-artifacts.toml (f6d5ba976b01c255c14e35fe93322bc5a082fa6dc3989546e5867007c5d37287) and release/publish-channel-contracts.toml (88d7ac055689c1e9fcd752c178eac9094ca29084a097fa7aff109c4fb0f40fd8); quality-mgr independently recomputed all three non-package-digest hashes via `shasum -a 256` against the live files and confirmed exact matches, resolving req-qa's ATM-QA-011-R2 tooling-gap concern; confirmed by arch-qa and ruthless-boundary-qa on PR #1064" ;
